# Local RMServer image fixtures (large, potentially sensitive)
tests/fixtures/rmserver/
tests/runtime/

# The crystal classifier's TorchScript source stays out; the ONNX the program
# actually loads is committed, because the beamline cannot build it. Its glibc
# is 2.17, and neither onnxruntime nor the onnx package has a wheel that old,
# so exporting there would mean a C++ toolchain and protobuf for one 16 MB
# file. Git is the hand-copy we already have, and the checksum in
# models/crystal3.json ties it back to the checkpoint it came from.
models/*.pt
models/*.pth
